1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,633
Good morning!

2
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:03,900
Mimzi wakes up and stretches.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,490
Good morning, Teddy!

4
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:07,200
Yawn!

5
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:08,968
Good morning!

6
00:00:08,968 --> 00:00:11,100
Time to brush your teeth!

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,775
Mimzi goes to the bathroom and gets her toothbrush.

8
00:00:17,325 --> 00:00:19,901
Here's my blue toothbrush!

9
00:00:21,601 --> 00:00:24,801
She squeezes a tiny dot of toothpaste.

10
00:00:25,051 --> 00:00:27,276
As small as a pea.

11
00:00:27,826 --> 00:00:30,252
Just a little bit!

12
00:00:31,952 --> 00:00:33,604
Brush, brush, brush.

13
00:00:33,604 --> 00:00:35,902
Up and down on the top teeth.

14
00:00:38,502 --> 00:00:40,171
Brush, brush, brush.

15
00:00:40,171 --> 00:00:43,002
Round and round on the bottom teeth.

16
00:00:46,752 --> 00:00:48,796
Don't forget the back teeth,

17
00:00:48,796 --> 00:00:50,577
and the front teeth too!

18
00:00:51,127 --> 00:00:53,827
Let's count while we brush.

19
00:00:54,077 --> 00:00:57,177
One, two, three, four, five!

20
00:00:58,877 --> 00:01:01,902
Spit, then rinse with a little water.

21
00:01:02,452 --> 00:01:05,227
Spit, splash, all clean!

22
00:01:06,927 --> 00:01:09,451
Look at my shiny teeth!

23
00:01:10,001 --> 00:01:12,626
Wow! Sparkly clean!

24
00:01:13,176 --> 00:01:15,546
We brush our teeth in the morning,

25
00:01:15,546 --> 00:01:17,276
and at night before bed.

26
00:01:18,976 --> 00:01:20,751
Did you like the story?

27
00:01:20,751 --> 00:01:22,800
Let's remember it together!

28
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:24,938
Do you remember?

29
00:01:24,938 --> 00:01:26,025
Let's see!

30
00:01:27,725 --> 00:01:29,700
What happened here?

31
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:33,574
Toothbrush!

32
00:01:34,124 --> 00:01:36,424
Yes! Well done!

33
00:01:38,124 --> 00:01:40,099
What happened here?

34
00:01:42,299 --> 00:01:43,973
Toothpaste!

35
00:01:44,523 --> 00:01:46,473
That's right!

36
00:01:48,173 --> 00:01:50,148
What happened here?

37
00:01:52,348 --> 00:01:53,746
Teeth!

38
00:01:54,296 --> 00:01:56,321
Great job!

39
00:01:58,021 --> 00:01:59,996
What happened here?

40
00:02:02,196 --> 00:02:03,747
Smile!

41
00:02:04,297 --> 00:02:06,272
You got it!

42
00:02:07,972 --> 00:02:09,947
What happened here?

43
00:02:12,147 --> 00:02:13,723
Rinse!

44
00:02:14,273 --> 00:02:15,973
Super!

45
00:02:17,673 --> 00:02:19,948
When do we brush our teeth?

46
00:02:22,148 --> 00:02:23,528
In the morning,

47
00:02:23,528 --> 00:02:25,598
and at night before bed!

48
00:02:26,148 --> 00:02:28,448
Yes! Well done!

49
00:02:30,148 --> 00:02:33,174
Wow! You remembered everything!

50
00:02:35,024 --> 00:02:37,674
You are a super learner!

51
00:02:39,374 --> 00:02:42,174
Great job, little learner!

52
00:02:42,724 --> 00:02:44,675
Share Mimzi with a friend,

53
00:02:44,675 --> 00:02:47,299
and subscribe for more learning fun!

54
00:02:47,849 --> 00:02:48,866
Next time,

55
00:02:48,866 --> 00:02:51,449
let's wash our hands together.

56
00:02:51,699 --> 00:02:53,425
Bye bye!
